  "notes": "{築|きず}く means to build or construct, used for both physical structures and abstract achievements.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle: ～⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{城|しろ}→城：03255_shiro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く: to build a castle\n- ⟦{関係|かんけい}→関係：01298_kankei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く: to build a relationship\n- ⟦{財産|ざいさん}→財産：01635_zaisan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く: to build wealth\n- ⟦{地位|ちい}→地位：03427_chii⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く: to establish a position\n- ⟦キャリア→キャリア：10821_kyaria⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く: to build a career\n- ⟦{人脈|じんみゃく}→人脈：18253_jinmyaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{築|きず}く: to build a network\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {築|きず}く (godan): to build\n- ⟦{気|き}づく→気づく：01933_kizuku⟧ (godan): to notice (different kanji and meaning)\n\nThe physical sense often appears in historical or literary contexts; the abstract sense is common in business and personal development.",
